<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cemex SA raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cemex SA raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- JP Morgan said it upgraded Cemex SA to buy from market performer.</p>
<p>-- cited &quot;extraordinary&quot; cash earnings growth of its Mexican operations and &quot;overall improved financial situation.&quot;</p>
</text>
